# ─── .NET build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything under bin/ and obj/ is regenerated by `dotnet build`. Tracking it
# meant every build showed up as ~166 modified files in `git status`.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# ─── Local database ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite dev database. Schema comes from EF migrations and content from
# DataSeeder, so it is fully reproducible — no reason to version the binary.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ─── Uploaded files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# User uploads live outside wwwroot and are served through an authorised
# endpoint. They are user data, never source.
storage/

# ─── Node ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ─── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
